# Azure IoT Hub root CA bundle (global cloud)
# Source: https://github.com/Azure/azure-iot-sdk-c/blob/main/certs/certs.c
#
# Contents:
#   1. DigiCert Global Root G2          (current RSA root)
#   2. Microsoft RSA Root CA 2017       (migration target RSA root)
#   3. DigiCert Global Root G3          (current ECC root)
#   4. Microsoft ECC Root CA 2017       (migration target ECC root)
#
# Baltimore CyberTrust Root is intentionally OMITTED — retired by Azure
# in Feb 2023 and will expire 2025-05-12.
#
# Use this file as the CA trust anchor on the PLC / device side
# (e.g. Beckhoff TF6701 stTLS.sCA).

